## 2026-09-30  Initial Idea 

My development consist of several wooden strips which will place square shape one by one. Each square will be rotated by different angles. It will finally be visible as a spiral cubic shape.

The concept will be pick/vacumme one  wooden strip from the place of storage, then move to assembly location, then rorate the gripper and then place/pressure wooden strip to build the shape of the structure. Then,robot will repeat the same procedure for next wooden strip.

